    Patch 1: patch1    ┃    Patch 2: patch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons use only the source
lines quoted in the patches.

═══════════════════════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES                        *
═══════════════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only that patch. A
sign-less line with one number is an edit both
patches make: a new number means both add it,
an old number means both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│f.c           ┃ old new│f.c
        │@@            ┃        │@@ int fx(void
        │              ┃        │)
   1   1│	c1     ┃   1   1│	c1
   2   2│	a_zulu ┃-  2    │	a_old
        │              ┃+      2│	a_p2
   3   3│	c2     ┃   3   3│	c2
   4    │	b_old  ┃   4    │	b_old
+      4│	b_p1   ┃+      4│	b_p2
   5   5│	mid_p1 ┃   5   5│	mid_p2
   6    │	d_old  ┃   6    │	d_old
+      6│	d_p1   ┃+      6│	d_p2
   7   7│	c3     ┃   7   7│	c3
   8   8│	c_zulu ┃-  8    │	c_old
        │              ┃+      8│	c_p2
   9   9│	c4     ┃   9   9│	c4

═══════════════════════════════════════════════
*    CONTEXT DIFFERENCES                      *
═══════════════════════════════════════════════
Signs mark lines present in only one result: -
patch1, + patch2.

